sequenceDiagram
    participant U as UI Worker (SvelteKit)
    participant A as API Worker (Hono)
    participant S as Supabase JWKS

    Note over U: @supabase/ssr holds session
    U->>A: request + JWT (service binding)
    Note over A: no supabase-js, no shared trust
    A->>S: fetch public JWKS (cached 1hr)
    S-->>A: signing keys
    A->>A: verify ES256 signature via Web Crypto
    A-->>U: response (only if signature + expiry check pass)
